course: dictionary
lesson: 11448
title: Names with capital letters
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words name one particular person, place or thing. These are called names, and they always start with a capital letter. «Aditya sat next to me in class.» Aditya is the name of one boy, so it starts with a capital A.
explain: Aditya is a boy's name that is common in India. It comes from Sanskrit, a very old language, and it is often taken to mean «the sun». You cannot work this out from the sentence alone, so when you meet a name with a meaning, check a dictionary.
explain: In Hindu tradition, the Adityas are a group of gods, and Aditya is a name for the sun god Surya. «Our class learned that Aditya is another name for the sun god.» Clues like the capital letter and the word class help you see that Aditya is a name, not an ordinary word.
fact: Aditya is a name, so it starts with a capital letter.
fact: Aditya is a boy's name common in India, from Sanskrit.
fact: Aditya is often taken to mean «the sun».
fact: In Hindu tradition, the Adityas are a group of gods, and Aditya is a name for the sun god Surya.
fact: Aditya-L1 is the name of India's space probe that studies the Sun.
exercise: «Aditya sat next to me in class.» What kind of word is Aditya? | A colour | *A name for a person | An action word | A place
exercise: «The space probe Aditya-L1 studies the Sun.» What does Aditya-L1 study? | The rain | The ocean | The Moon | *The Sun
exercise: «Aditya is often taken to mean the sun.» Which word does the meaning of Aditya link to? | A bicycle | A river | *The sun | Rain
test: Which sentence is written correctly? | my friend aditya is kind. | my Friend Aditya is kind. | *My friend Aditya is kind. | My friend aditya is kind.
test: In Hindu tradition, Aditya is a name for which god? | Lakshmi, the goddess of wealth | *Surya, the sun god | Ganesh, the elephant god | Hanuman, the monkey god
exam: Which is the best meaning of the name Aditya? | Sun-tinted rain | A river | *The sun | A big house
